WEBVTT

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:04.520
The year is 2205 A.D.

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:14.860
To annihilate the History Retrograde Army,
who scheme to alter history...

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:19.450
...we, who were born from swords...

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:24.580
...engage in mortal combat today as well!

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.040
<i>Meetings and partings (Yes! Yes!)</i>

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:32.210
<i>In the direction the sun rises (Yes! Yes!)</i>

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:42.730
<i>Now, let's move forward, one step at a time,</i>
<i>as each flower blossoms (Oh, yay!)</i>

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:47.770
"Touken Ranbu Hanamaru S2"

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:47.940
<i>(Woo!)</i>

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.530
<i>Rather than be anxious,</i>
<i>yes, it's better to believe</i>

00:00:55.530 --> 00:01:01.200
<i>Always rich in mind and spirit,</i>
<i>staying positive every day</i>

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:06.870
<i>Real strength is how we master what we each</i>

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:10.210
<i>Already have</i>

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:14.010
<i>If you try to rush virtue</i>

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>It won't go well at all</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:20.390
<i>Think as you look up at the sky</i>

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:25.730
<i>Step forward firmly, with assurance</i>

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:27.020
<i>Ready, set! Ready, go!</i>

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:29.020
<i>In a Hanamaru way</i>

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:31.650
<i>Laugh and cry</i>

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:34.990
<i>Without reserve</i>

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:39.570
<i>Under the bright, sunny sky</i>

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:42.120
<i>When you reach</i>

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:45.330
<i>The next street</i>

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:56.010
<i>Start walking again, one step at a time,</i>
<i>as each flower blossoms (Oh, woo!)</i>

00:01:57.470 --> 00:02:01.220
Hey, Master, today's snack is <i>zunda mocha</i>.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:02.760
I'm leaving now.

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:04.930
Kara, you eat with us, too!

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:09.140
"This anime is about the
stories of the Hanamaru days

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:14.070
of a certain group of
Sword Warriors in a certain citadel."

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:37.010
Kikkou-<i>dono</i>, do you have
business in Master's room?

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:40.550
I thought I'd talk with the master for a bit.

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:48.680
Hello, I am Kikkou Sadamune.

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:55.480
"60 - Uchigatana, Kikkou Sadamune"

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:51.480
I'm a sword passed down in
the family of General Tokugawa.

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:52.810
My current name comes from

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:55.770
an engraved crest with the
appearance of a <i>kikkou</i>, or tortoiseshell.

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:56.860
And you are?

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:04.530
"61 - Uchigatana, Sengo Muramasa"

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:00.780
I am Sengo Muramasa.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:05.450
Yes, the Muramasa also
known as the "bewitched sword."

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:10.080
Rather than a greeting, shall I undress?

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:11.000
Don't strip!

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.960
That's why you're misunderstood!

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:17.300
I don't mind. Let them say whatever they want.

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:23.550
I'm fine. I believe what's under
a person's clothes should stay hidden.

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.470
Too bad.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:28.430
Well then, excuse me.

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:32.270
You again? Master needs
to begin today's work.

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:33.480
Don't get in the way.

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:36.020
Then I will sit beside the master
and gaze upon them.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:38.650
That's not what I meant...

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:41.570
Are you a new Sword Warrior?

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:43.950
My name is Sengo Muramasa.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:46.780
He is a Muramasa sword, like me.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:49.580
In other words,
I'm part of the Muramasa family.

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:51.460
I'm Heshikiri Hasebe.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:54.420
I am Master's attendant.

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:57.750
Master's attendant?

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:01.470
I tidy up around Master
so they can be comfortable,

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:03.340
"No wasting money!!"

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:03.550
sometimes helping with work,

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:06.050
sometimes telling everyone Master's orders.

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:12.310
In addition, I perform other duties to help
Master in my important and honorable job.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:12.230
"Herbs"

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:15.310
Master, how's your work coming along?

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:18.440
Hey, you! What are you
doing without permission?!

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:19.730
Excuse me.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:22.280
--If you need anything,
feel free to order me to do it.
--Hurry up and--

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.780
Listen, Muramasa.

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:27.410
Be careful not to do anything
that would cause trouble for Master.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:29.200
I understand.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.080
Tonbokiri, we've got an expedition.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.330
Get ready.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:36.670
Very well. You should learn
everything else from Kashuu-<i>dono</i>.

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:38.670
Roger that.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:43.300
Kashuu, the expedition
this time is on the long side.

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:44.470
Oh yeah?

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:47.340
I'm leaving the citadel to you while I'm gone.

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:50.310
Roger. Have a nice trip.

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:56.560
While he's gone,
I will be the master's attendant.

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.110
Where did that come from?

00:04:58.110 --> 00:04:59.860
Sounds interesting!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:02.990
I would like to run for that position, as well.

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:05.150
Muramasa, you too?

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:09.950
Don't you think that to fulfill
such an honorable position

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:12.950
so soon after coming to the
citadel would make me a legend?

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:16.670
No, being Master's attendant
isn't really like that--

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:18.670
Therefore, I will do it.

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:20.460
No, I will not yield.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:25.970
Although I am a newcomer, no one
is more attached to the master than I.

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:28.050
It is a duty that I should perform.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.800
Then, let us have a contest!

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:34.780
--Kashuu, will you referee our contest?

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:34.780
--Kashuu-<i>san</i>, will you be
the referee for our contest?

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:36.690
What?

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:45.400
We must create a good
environment for the master to be in.

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:47.700
So first, we should clean.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:51.200
It is important to have both body
and possessions in good order.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:54.700
Cleaning must be quick and neat.

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:57.750
Whoever finishes wiping to
the end of the hall first wins.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:00.460
We'll call this the
"Fastest Wiper First Contest"!

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:02.210
Very well.

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:05.920
"Mr. Spick-and-Span the Second"
"Concentrate"

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:04.250
By the way, what is this?

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:06.340
It is Mr. Spick-and-Span the Second!

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:10.260
Apparently, it is a wonderful product that
allows you to clean and polish at the same time.

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:12.760
That's amazing.

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:16.600
Then, in order to clean
everything up faster, let's use a lot!

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:18.060
"Concentrate"

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.890
Wait! You don't need much--

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:23.020
We're all ready.

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.320
I'm getting excited.

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:34.330
Okay then, here we go!

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.160
Ready...

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.540
...go!

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.750
I'll be going ahead.

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:42.420
Whoops!

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:45.300
<i>I</i> will be going ahead!

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.800
I have blundered.

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:52.470
I'm not finished yet.

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:53.850
I won't lose!

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:03.440
And then, Nihongou was like--

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:04.440
Oh?

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:06.190
B-Big Brother!

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:09.610
I'm going through.

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:12.490
Excuse me.

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:15.370
S-Stop me...!

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:21.870
Everyone, are you all right?

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.460
"Draw"

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:41.440
Well? What's next?

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:44.270
Male warriors must have endurance,

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:47.980
and there are times when
they must clash in the buff.

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:51.530
This contest combines the two--

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:54.240
I call it the "Hot, Hot Endurance Contest"!

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:57.450
"This contest can only be undertaken by
Sword Warriors because of their training.
Please do not try this at home."

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.500
Oh, really.

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:02.040
Sorry I'm late.

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:06.000
What are you wearing?

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:09.630
I don't really like to show any skin.

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:12.470
Also, even if I might be at
a disadvantage for wearing this,

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:15.550
it won't give me an advantage.

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:18.180
Well, that's true.

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:21.430
I am naked, but I won't go easy on you.

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:48.540
Everyone has one or two secrets to hide.

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:50.800
I-I see...

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:53.590
I can't take it anymore. I'll be outside.

00:08:57.800 --> 00:09:00.060
You're pretty good.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:03.020
But aren't you at your limit?

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:06.850
No, I've become even more excited.

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:07.020
"Coffee Milk"

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:20.280
I heard a weird sound. You guys okay?

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:29.750
"Draw"

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:33.460
Are you two really okay now?

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:35.670
Sorry for making you worry.

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.800
I'm completely fine now.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:40.260
What shall we do for our next contest?

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.310
What, you're not done yet?

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:44.770
That's surprising!

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:46.980
What are you doing?

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:50.560
I'm showing everyone
magic tricks as I practice.

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:52.480
It's amazing!

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:57.570
He makes things appear from
empty hands and can tell what I'm thinking!

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:01.240
Even watching up close,
I can't tell how he's doing it.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:03.990
Then next, I'll escape from a rope.

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:07.710
Please put that towel over my hands.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.210
Is this okay?

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:13.250
Yes! Okay, here I go.

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:22.930
Ta-da!

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:26.640
You didn't tie that very well.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:29.190
You must tie it more firmly.

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:33.070
Then, let us do this next.

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:38.400
We each tie someone here up,
and whoever's knots aren't untied will win.

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:39.860
What kind of contest is that?

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:41.160
I see.

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:45.830
Just in case someone gets
into the master's room,

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:49.500
we can see who would be able
to tie up the intruder the fastest.

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:52.670
That's right. It is important
in times of emergency.

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:56.590
I call it the "Binding Hand and Foot Contest"!

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:00.510
This will be the final contest.

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:02.300
Let's decide things.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:03.930
That's just what I wanted!

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:07.810
I'm finished.

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:09.230
I am, as well.

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:11.770
Now, let's have...

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:13.810
...an honest contest!

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:19.070
Oh? I have been tied up.

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:22.870
So I just need to untie this?

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:25.950
Yes, but it won't be easy--

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:31.580
Wha--?!

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:33.080
That's surprising!

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:34.840
How did you do that?

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:37.500
It's a se-cr-et.

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:41.930
I'm not as adept as Nikkari-<i>dono</i>, but...

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:54.270
Iwatooshi, that was cool!

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:56.570
That was pretty fun.

00:11:56.570 --> 00:11:59.070
It looks like you chose the wrong people.

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:01.450
Well, isn't this a draw, too?

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:02.860
"Draw"

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:05.820
In that case, I challenge
you to a sparring match!

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:09.080
Very well, I accept!

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:10.790
I'm back.

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.080
Welcome home.

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:14.170
Were there any changes?

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:15.710
Not really.

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:16.920
I see.

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.880
What are you two doing?

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:22.090
If you have time to play around,
then at least go train.

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:25.300
I will go give my report to Master.

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:29.680
What in the world were we fighting for?

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:36.110
I had fun with the contests, though.

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:41.360
Yeah, I did, too.

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:43.570
I won't lose next time.

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:45.610
Just what I wanted.

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:52.450
What the heck?

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:09.560
Uguisumaru-<i>sama</i>, what are you doing?

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:11.060
I was writing...

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:12.560
...in this.

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:16.480
An observation diary about Ookanehira-<i>sama</i>?

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:20.770
Yeah. All of the Awataguchis
keep diaries, too, right?

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:23.690
I thought it looked interesting.

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:28.030
Actually, I still haven't talked
much to Ookanehira-<i>sama</i>,

00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:30.490
so I don't really know him.

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:38.500
Uguisumaru-<i>sama</i>, will you
tell me about Ookanehira-<i>sama</i>?

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:39.840
Sure.

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:44.210
"Today's Chore Assignments:
Horse Duty - Mikazuki, Oodenta
Field Duty - Ookanehira, Juzumaru"

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:47.010
Ookanehira looks showy,
but he's actually very earnest.

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:47.180
"Field Duty - Ookanehira"

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:51.760
Field duty? Leave it to me.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:53.350
"62 - Tachi, Ookanehira"

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:54.520
I'm good at simple tasks.

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.350
Wait, why are you drinking tea?!

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:59.020
Don't you all have chores to do, too?!

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:02.940
Well, don't worry about the details.

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:06.780
We are already finished with our work. Right?

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:12.030
Yeah. I tried to finish everything
without getting close to the horses.

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:14.580
And you call yourself one of
the Five Great Swords of Japan?

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:17.290
I was discovered by Ikeda Terumasa.

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:22.340
I am not one of the Five Great Swords,
but it is just because I was discovered late.

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:24.630
Why are you hung up about that?

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:28.680
It doesn't have anything to do with
being one of the Five Great Swords, does it?

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:32.260
Ookanehira, you care too much
about the "Five Great Swords" title.

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:35.810
Quiet! You lot cannot understand my feelings!

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:39.810
I have field duty with you today?

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:41.310
I'm counting on you.

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:44.230
I am counting on you, also.

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:46.400
Today, we're planting daikon.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:49.030
--He's acting completely different
from when he was with us.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:49.030
--Let me teach you how to sow the seeds.

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:49.610
--He's acting completely different
from when he was with us.

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:49.610
--This way.

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:50.700
Okay!

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:56.160
Create a shallow depression
in the ground like this,

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:59.160
and then put four to five
seeds in each depression.

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:03.170
Don't forget to cover it
with soil after you finish.

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:05.090
I thank you for your instruction.

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:10.090
Then, I will work in that area over there,

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:15.310
so please plant seeds in all
the rows over here, Ookanehira-<i>dono</i>.

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:17.520
Okay, got it.

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:23.190
Create a shallow depression...

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:26.400
Put four to five seeds in...

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:30.990
After that, don't forget
to cover it with soil...

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:33.370
All right, I did it.

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:36.330
Create a shallow depression...

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:38.870
Put four to five seeds in...

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:41.370
Create a shallow depression...

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:43.670
Put four to five seeds in...

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:46.340
Create a shallow depression...

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:48.710
Put four to five seeds in...

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:51.340
Create a shallow depression...

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:54.640
Put four to five seeds in...

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:57.100
Create a shallow depression...

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:59.560
Put four to five seeds in...

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:02.230
Create a shallow depression...

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:06.900
Ookanehira is very earnest, isn't he?

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:11.650
Yeah, he's so earnest that
he has a hard time being flexible.

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:16.780
Now that you mention it, you went to the beach
with Ookanehira-<i>sama</i> before, too, right?

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:19.500
Yeah, I did.

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:22.410
One, two!

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:24.210
--One, two!
--One, two!

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:26.170
One, two!

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:29.880
Point goes to the Red Team!

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:34.800
Even though it was just
a game, he gave it his all.

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:36.680
Looking good, looking good!

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:38.470
As expected of Micchan!

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:40.430
Good job, Mitsu-<i>bou</i>!

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:42.600
It's thanks to the two of you!

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:44.060
Just one more point...

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:46.400
"14      - 3 -      08"
"Black Team  |  White Team"

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:46.480
...and we'll win!

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:50.030
Damn it! If only
I had gotten that ball just now!

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:51.190
Don't be discouraged!

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:52.570
It's not your fault.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:57.320
Yeah, not even my little brother, um...

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:58.370
Hizamaru.

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:01.080
...could have gotten that.
It couldn't be helped.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:03.790
Let's do our best for the next ball.

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:05.790
But if we lose this, it'll all be over.

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:08.840
Even if this is just a game, I cannot lose!

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:11.550
Please, lend me your strength!

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:18.180
If we don't answer his call here, then
the name of the Minamoto Clan will die out.

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:23.230
Yes, we will show you our power.

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:27.810
Here I go!

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:35.280
Good job, Big Bro!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:36.660
Go, Ookanehira!

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:37.740
Right!

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:40.200
We'll get one point first, with this!

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:41.490
I won't...

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:42.750
...let you!

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:44.290
Nice, Micchan!

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.910
Hit it, Sada-<i>bou</i>!

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.920
Okay! Take this!

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:52.300
Trinity Assault Strike!

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:51.130
"Trinity Assault Strike"

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:54.260
What?!

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:55.260
Shoot!

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:56.550
Leave it to me!

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:57.800
That's reckless!

00:17:57.800 --> 00:17:59.140
I will definitely...

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:00.510
...get it!

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:03.180
Ookanehira!

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:05.600
Forget about me!
More importantly, the ball!

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:07.850
We'll definitely keep this going, Big Bro!

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:09.860
Yeah, shall we?

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:13.230
"Flying Double-Sword Attack"

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:14.030
Flying Double-Sword Attack!

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:21.950
Point goes to the White Team!

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:25.200
That was amazing.
I can't believe you got that ball!

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:28.790
As expected of the man called
the Yokozuna of Sword Warriors.

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:34.050
That was nothing!

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:39.640
Ookanehira-<i>sama</i> is very hardworking, isn't he?

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:45.310
Yeah, he's so hardworking that
there are times he's working in vain.

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:47.560
And times when he gets injured.

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:48.940
Injured...?

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:51.440
Now that you mention it,
when he was dispatched the other day,

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:54.900
Ookanehira-<i>sama</i> was injured pretty badly...

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:57.860
Yeah.

00:18:57.860 --> 00:19:02.740
But that was also proof of his manliness.

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:05.580
Your destination is the
Genroku era in the Edo period.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:09.580
The captain will be you, Ookanehira.

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:13.790
"Edo Period - Genroku Era"

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:24.390
Over here! Over here!

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:29.230
I'll do it!

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:36.150
It looks like you're having
a hard time. Do you need help?

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:38.820
I'm a famous sword equal to Doujigiri.

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:40.490
Don't look down on me!

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:48.200
What?!

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:51.370
The Kebiishi?

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:05.180
Why are the Kebiishi attacking
the History Retrograde Army?

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:09.560
I don't know, but I think
we should retreat for now.

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:14.480
Very well. Everyone, retreat!

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:20.030
Shinano!

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:24.530
Ookanehira-<i>dono</i>, please help Shinano!

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:39.510
Ookanehira-<i>san</i>!

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:42.260
Don't worry about it.

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:45.760
Part of the job of a captain
is to protect those under him.

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:50.270
This time, it's my turn!

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:58.520
This is my special move!

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:06.820
Is that right?

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:10.740
So Ookanehira-<i>sama</i> saved Shinano?

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:12.450
Yeah.

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:16.540
Why didn't anyone tell us?

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:20.210
"If I had been stronger,
then I wouldn't have gotten injured,

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:22.550
and we would not have had to retreat.

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:25.180
It is shameful, so please keep quiet about it."

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:28.640
Ookanehira told us not to tell anyone.

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:31.890
So let's keep this a secret, okay?

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:35.940
Okay! We'll keep this between us.

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:38.650
Well, it's his way of hiding his embarrassment.

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:42.400
Ookanehira-<i>sama</i> is a
really wonderful person, isn't he?

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:43.900
What about me?

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:45.740
Ookanehira-<i>sama</i>!

00:21:46.410 --> 00:21:48.530
Has your injury healed?

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:51.660
An injury like that isn't a big deal.

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:53.950
By the way, what were you talking about?

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:57.080
You looked like you were having a lot of fun.

00:21:58.880 --> 00:22:00.290
--A secret.
--It's a secret.

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:04.420
Oh, well.

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:07.630
Since you're here, would you like some tea?

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:09.760
We have sweets to go with it, too!

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:10.780
Sure!

00:22:19.060 --> 00:22:24.940
"Ookanehira
Observation Diary"

00:23:54.990 --> 00:24:01.550
"More <i>Hanamaru</i> Next Week!!"
